{"id":"n87885-1-7","stage":3,"title":"흐름 · 流","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87885-1-7-1","ko":"비가 너무 안 와서 시냇물이 점점 마르겠어.","zh":"雨下得太少了，小溪的水快要干掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"시냇물이","meaning":"溪水","explanation":"시냇물：溪水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시냇물","audio":"/audio/1af51a74680d15650c02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65970","senseId":"1","lemma":"시냇물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시냇물이","audio":"/audio/b2fb56f7146d848be971.mp3"}},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越。","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/a